  "quotes": [
    {"club":8,"text":"In terms of injuries, and in terms of the squad, we are having the last training session tomorrow, so no one is ruled out for us for Friday. So, I prefer to be cautious and we will wait till tomorrow to take the final decision on every player.","said":"Xabi Alonso","about":"the Chelsea team news","at":"2026-09-17T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":8,"text":"He is getting closer and tomorrow, we will take a final decision in the team and in the squad that is coming to Brentford.","said":"Xabi Alonso","about":"Moises Caicedo","at":"2026-09-17T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":8,"text":"No, it was just a decision for Tuesday and we will see his development. Tomorrow, we will decide.","said":"Xabi Alonso","at":"2026-09-17T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":4,"text":"Amar will be also not able to play on Saturday.","said":"Matthias Jaissle","about":"Amar Dedic","at":"2026-09-17T13:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":4,"text":"Still not a real update on Anthony. I have just spoken with him now. I think, in the next 30 minutes, he will have an MRI, so we will get more clarity then. We hope that it is not that serious.","said":"Matthias Jaissle","about":"Anthony Elanga","at":"2026-09-17T13:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":4,"text":"It will be a young midfield. I heard just also from a pundit [asking] why I was playing with such young players – because we have only young players in the squad! JJ [Ramsey] is injured as well.","said":"Matthias Jaissle","at":"2026-09-17T13:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":17,"text":"[Other than] Savona and Milenkovic, all other players will be fit.","said":"Oliver Glasner","at":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":17,"text":"But on the other side, we also could see that both were a little bit struggling physically at the end. I think this is what we still need to improve, and that there are no doubts that they can play even 100 minutes or 105 minutes if it’s necessary.","said":"Oliver Glasner","at":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":17,"text":"Igor Jesus scored a goal now as well. He was rewarded with the Golden Shoe of the Europa League because he can score goals, but he’s, let’s say, more the ‘playing’ striker, dropping into the pocket, and then we had no striker with power and runs in behind. This is what we were looking for and yeah, I think that’s exactly what Liam [Delap] showed.","said":"Oliver Glasner","at":"2026-09-17T13:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":94,"text":"I think it’s more or less the same as the other night, yeah. So, nothing has really changed on that front.","said":"Keith Andrews","about":"the latest Brentford team news","at":"2026-09-17T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":88,"text":"He’s in the concussion protocol. So, seven days off, and after this, he will go to the national team. Everything is fine. He’s good. This is the most important [thing], now. He will miss this game.","said":"Sergej Jakirovic","about":"Nobel Mendy","at":"2026-09-17T12:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":88,"text":"Morita is still out. The plan is that he will join us after the first week of the international break.","said":"Sergej Jakirovic","at":"2026-09-17T12:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":88,"text":"We will see. We are very cautious with him and unfortunately, he cannot help the team.","said":"Sergej Jakirovic","about":"Charlie Hughes","at":"2026-09-17T12:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":9,"text":"I would expect not available, yeah.","said":"Frank Lampard","about":"Aurele Amenda","at":"2026-09-17T07:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":9,"text":"I thought he was fantastic. He’s a very, very good player. He’s 18 years of age but he’s come in with a real maturity on and off the pitch and it was good to see a player of such ability and composure come in and play the way he played. I thought he was great and it’s just a start.","said":"Frank Lampard","about":"Stephen Mfuni","at":"2026-09-17T07:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":9,"text":"Haji’s on track, but he’s not obviously ready soon.","said":"Frank Lampard","at":"2026-09-17T07:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":3,"text":"In form, in the opponent, in the relationship that we have within that unit, there are a lot of factors [in deciding who starts between Eze and Christos Tzolis on the left].","said":"Mikel Arteta","about":"Eberechi Eze on the left wing","at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":14,"text":"Everyone is ready to go. We are in the same place we were, the three long-term injuries plus Federico. The others, nothing. Okay, we still need to train tomorrow and travel, but everyone is fine.","said":"Andoni Iraola","at":"2026-09-18T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":1,"text":"It is really short term [with Luke], to be honest, but it’s just working towards the game. So, we’ll see how he is come the weekend.","said":"Michael Carrick","at":"2026-09-18T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":6,"text":"Porro, Tonali, Maddison, all are available to play. Normally, we have to understand the situation in terms of physical condition, but all of them are ready.","said":"Roberto De Zerbi","at":"2026-09-18T11:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":7,"text":"We have so many players injured. It’s difficult to mention every one. Marco is out, Onana, Cisse out, Pau, Maatsen out, Goretzka out, Madjo out. I think that’s enough. The other players are ready.","said":"Unai Emery","at":"2026-09-18T13:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":36,"text":"I think that the best thing for Femi is that he uses this [international break] to get back on his highest physical level and then get used to our style of play. Then, we will try to work with him individually and hopefully integrate him back into the team, then definitely after the international break, he will be on a top level and we can use him in games.","said":"Fabian Hurzeler","about":"Femi Azeez","at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":36,"text":"He’s young, he will recover fast. He definitely will be an option for tomorrow.","said":"Fabian Hurzeler","about":"Luka Vuskovic","at":"2026-09-18T08:00:00.000Z"},
    {"club":56,"text":"We’ll see. We have different options. It’s one of these options.","said":"Regis Le Bris","about":"if Dayann Methalie comes in for Reinildo this weekend","at":"2026-09-18T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":11,"text":"Merlin Röhl is not available yet, hopefully he’ll be ready at the end of the international break.","said":"David Moyes","at":"2026-09-18T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":4,"text":"For now, we hope that three or four players are ready to be in the squad. I think Joe[linton], you saw already [in the open training session last week], he was partially invovled there. He’s now progressing, he’s doing better and better. Also, one of the others is coming back, definitely, and this is helpful, for sure, but we need to be smart as well in the load management. They have the potential to be in the squad but, for sure, not in the starting XI.","said":"Matthias Jaissle","at":"2026-10-08T13:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":4,"text":"They have returned but not everyone was today in. I have allowed some of them an extra day [off]. Tomorrow, we will be fully back. We are, in general, pleased [by the lack of new injuries]. Ewen was a difficult one, with a hamstring. He will be out for a couple of months, but the rest should be okay.","said":"Matthias Jaissle","about":"his returning internationals","at":"2026-10-08T13:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":91,"text":"It depends, we are going to see. I am not a doctor. It’s a muscle injury and we do [a scan] in some days again, but we are going to miss him, for sure, for four or five weeks.","said":"Marco Rose","about":"the length of Alex Scott’s absence","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":91,"text":"Brooksy is fully in team training.","said":"Marco Rose","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":91,"text":"We have still [got] injuries but most of the lads are back on the pitch with rehab coaches or in parts of training with the team, so yeah, we can see light at the end of the tunnel. Maybe for the Graz [match on Thursday] or the Sunderland game [next Sunday], we’re going to have one or two players back. Nearly everyone is back on the pitch, just Alex [who is not].","said":"Marco Rose","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":56,"text":"It’s a shame for Ballard because he was in a good place and he will be sidelined for a few weeks. A medium-term injury, so we’ll keep you updated. For Brian, like Habib, they are on the same schedule and will be available soon. [Habib is] really close. He’s in a good place. Almost every session is needed for the full recovery. So, in around one week, he’ll be fully available. It’s going to be short-term [for Brobbey, as well]. It’s really positive, we were a bit worried when we saw the video but Brian, just after the game, wasn’t too worried because he experienced different injuries in the past. This one, he was adamant that it wasn’t too serious – and it’s the case. We won’t take too many risks, but it won’t be too long.","said":"Regis Le Bris","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":2,"text":"Joe Rodon is on his way back in his rehab, he is doing good progress. He has already had individual sessions on the pitch but it’ll be a bit before he’s back in team training. Daniel James will miss the Arsenal game. He is out with a back injury. Jean-Matteo came back with an ankle strain. Looks way better. He was today the first time with us out on the pitch. We have to wait right now [to see] how his body reacts but it seems like there is a chance he is available. Some good news with Harry Wilson after his muscle injury. He’s back in team training since Tuesday. Again, we also have to wait right now [to see] how his body reacts but there is also chance for him to be available.","said":"Daniel Farke","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":9,"text":"Milan is back training with us, so that’s good news. We hope he’ll be alright if he comes through the next few days. Kaine is back training with us, which is good. He’s been out for longer.","said":"Frank Lampard","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":9,"text":"Josh isn’t back yet and he’s had a baby recently, which is good news for him, but he’ll still be a few more weeks, potentially. Haji and Woolfy are a little bit longer, as well, but working hard and getting there. Haji won’t be back until November. I don’t want to put pressure on because it’s an awkward injury. Aurele is working away. It’s a 2-3 month injury, so we’re working through that.","said":"Frank Lampard","at":"2026-10-08T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":8,"text":"He’s ready to go. Finally! You have been asking this question and we have used the time with Moi to be back fit. He’s been training good and he’s okay to go.","said":"Xabi Alonso","about":"Moises Caicedo","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":8,"text":"Yes, they have been able to train, some of them earlier than others. Marco Palestra, as well. So, we have used the time and that was the plan. We knew that against Brenford, we were in with some players struggling, but now they have trained well and they are ready to go. For the next block of games to the next international games, we have five Premier League games and and hopefully they will be available as long [as possible], but for tomorrow they will be good.","said":"Xabi Alonso","about":"Joao Pedro, Cole Palmer and Reece James","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":8,"text":"He has trained the last week. He’s felt better. We didn’t want to rush because we had enough time. What the most important thing is for Cole is to be fully fit, that he enjoys his game, that he’s feeling okay. Whenever he’s not, like the Brentford game, we could see that he was struggling. Fom the next part, we have a good feeling with him and that he’s feeling better.","said":"Xabi Alonso","about":"Cole Palmer","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":3,"text":"With Kai, because he had a muscular injury, so I spoke to Jürgen [Klopp] and immediately they sent the player back, as is normal. Ezri because he’s been carrying some issues as well and we had good communication with the England camp about that. Tzolis has a muscle injury and he’s going to be out I think for a few weeks. He’s not available. Ezri and Kai we will see tomorrow.","said":"Mikel Arteta","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":3,"text":"We have to manage him because he’s been with a few issues since he’s come back from the World Cup and we know the amount of games that he’s played in the last three years. It was the sensible thing to do, and hopefully tomorrow he’s available and some others as well who are in doubt.","said":"Mikel Arteta","about":"Declan Rice’s withdrawal","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":3,"text":"Yeah, they are both available. They did incredibly well to be available for the Brighton game, we decided not to use them at the end, especially in the manner that we had to play the last few minutes, but they are both available. And Ben White is available as well.","said":"Mikel Arteta","about":"Cristhian Mosquera and Piero Hincapie","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":43,"text":"He’s good, he’s good. He went to Marbella, two or three days off, played golf, recovered, and is ready for Anfield. He is good.","said":"Enzo Maresca","about":"Erling Haaland","at":"2026-10-09T09:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":14,"text":"Alex Isak and Cody Gakpo will not play the game. They are not ready. Unfortunately for us, both got injuries during the international break. Cody has an ankle injury. He has had some before in his career and it is a matter of him dealing with the pain. It was a really bad tackle, I think. He is doing things individually but will not be ready for Sunday. Alex has a thigh injury. It is a small injury, but it is a muscle injury, and the same: whenever he feels ready. They both don’t look long term. We will be analysing day to day but they are not going to arrive on Sunday.","said":"Andoni Iraola","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":14,"text":"He’s fit. He’s ready to go. He didn’t play with the national team the last game because of protection but he should be fine. Still we need to train tomorrow, but he’s fine, yes.","said":"Andoni Iraola","about":"Jeremy Jacquet","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":14,"text":"We will maybe recover Fede Chiesa but he hasn’t played any minutes. He’s recovering from an injury but he has been doing a good job in the international break and has been training with the small group we had.","said":"Andoni Iraola","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":1,"text":"Ben is further away, with the issue he has got. He won’t be ready.","said":"Michael Carrick","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":1,"text":"Patrick came off and it looks like he will be out for probably a number of weeks. Nous came off and took a knock. He’s not quite right yet, so we’ll have to see how he is.","said":"Michael Carrick","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":1,"text":"Amad has done a little bit of training, Marcus has done a little bit of training, Kobbie has done a little bit of training.","said":"Michael Carrick","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":6,"text":"No, they are available to play. Micky played four games, 90 minutes, around 90 minutes. JP played just three games, the difference is this. JP, yesterday, [his] wife [gave birth] to twins. The emotional aspect, we have to consider also this one, but both are available to play.","said":"Roberto De Zerbi","about":"Micky van de Ven and Jan Paul van Hecke","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":6,"text":"He is available but he lost three/four days in the beginning of this week and the end of the last week. Like I said many times, James is a special player for us, as a player, for sure, but also as a personality. Also Gallagher, I think he is playing well, especially in the last two games, Liverpool and Villa.","said":"Roberto De Zerbi","about":"James Maddison","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":6,"text":"Pedro and Mudryk, both are not available. Pedro, I think not for many games. For Mudryk, maybe something more.","said":"Roberto De Zerbi","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":17,"text":"Nikola Milenkovic… returned from injury and played the friendly, was all good, but in a duel, he has a bone bruise and he will miss the game. It’s very painful and he can’t train. The other one is Igor Jesus. He has a muscle injury in his calf and he will be out for a few weeks, how it looks like. So that was not really what we wanted. And the other one who is questionable is Neco Williams. He returned well and was good, he trained with us yesterday but didn’t feel well. He got a fever in the night, so he was not available today. Let’s see how he recovers.","said":"Oliver Glasner","at":"2026-10-09T12:30:00.000Z"},
    {"club":94,"text":"Antoni and Josh definitely won’t be involved tomorrow. The rest of them have been on the grass, been around training. The one benefit of the last few weeks has been players like Nathan, Sepp, Matty [Jensen] getting back up to speed and getting close to a return. So, overall, when the players go away for that length of time and the amount of games some of them played, I think we’ve come through it pretty well. We’re in a good place for the next chapter.","said":"Keith Andrews","at":"2026-10-09T12:15:00.000Z"}
  ],
